  "content": "[Intro]\n[Am]\n[Am/G]\n[Fmaj7]\n[Em]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Am]\nOn the\nside of a hill, [G]In a\nland called \"somewhere,\"\nA little boy\n[C]lies\nasleep in the\n[G]earth.\nWhile\n[Em]down in the [D]valley, A cruel\n[C]war ra-\n[G]ges, [Bm]\nAnd\n[Am]people forget [G]what a\n[C]child's life\n[D]is worth.\n[Em]\n\n[Bridge]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Am]\nOn the\nside of a hill, [G]A\n[C]little cloud [G]weeps,\nAnd\nwaters the grave\n[C]\nwith it's [D]silent\n[G]tears.\nWhile a\n[Em]soldier cleans, [D]And\n[C]polishes a gun,\n[G]  [Bm]\nThat en-\n[Am]ded a life [G]at the\n[C]age of se-\n[D]ven years.\n[Em]\n\n[Bridge]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Am]\nAnd the\nwar rages on, [G]In a land\ncalled \"somewhere,\"\nAnd generals\n[C]order\ntheir men to kill,\n[G]\nAnd to fight\n[Em]for a cause [D]they've long\n[C]ago for-\n[G]gotten, [Bm]\nWhile a\n[Am]little cloud weeps, [G]\nOn the\n[C]side\n[D]of a\n\n[Outro]\n[G]hill.\n[C]\n[Cmaj7]\n[G/B]  [D]\n[G]",
